  "title": "AI-Generated Novel Removed from French Literary Prize",
  "summary": "Thélyson Orélien's novel, *It Was Either That or Die*, was initially highlighted as a top literary work in France before an anonymous AI claim sparked controversy. The French literary prize removed the novel from the shortlist, citing concerns about its creation being entirely AI-generated.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Thélyson Orélien's novel *It Was Either That or Die* was the hit of the French literary season.",
